<title>USA: Intelligent Electronics Inc Q4 loss flat.</title>
<headline>Intelligent Electronics Inc Q4 loss flat.</headline>
<dateline>EXTON, Pa. 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months ended     Year ended</p>
<p>				Feb 1,   Feb 3,     Feb 1,     Feb 3,</p>
<p>				 1997	1996	1997	 1996</p>
<p> Revenues		  739,932  934,823  3,346,557  3,588,099</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold    704,375  892,126  3,190,683  3,432,262</p>
<p> Net loss		   (5,044)  (4,911)  (104,054)   (19,488)</p>
<p> Preferred stock dividend  120	---	  120	  ---</p>
<p> Net loss after pfd divs(5,164) (4,911)  (104,174)   (19,488)</p>
<p> Loss per share	    (0.14)   (0.14)     (2.98)     (0.59)</p>
<p> Wgtd avg shrs	    35,806   34,537     34,988     32,794</p>
<p>		  (in thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 year loss includes $61.6 million of impairment losses, $9.8 million for branch closures, and $21.7 million of other charges, all in the third quarter totalling $93.1 million. Excluding the Q3 items, the net loss for the year was $15.6 million, or $.45 per common share.</p>
